      "v": 7,
      "zh": "从我们列祖直到今日，我们的罪恶甚重；因我们的罪孽，我们和君王、祭司都交在外邦列王的手中，杀害、掳掠、抢夺、脸上蒙羞正如今日的光景。",
      "en": "From the days of our fathers until this very day our guilt has been great. Because of our iniquities we, along with our kings and[NOTE:1] priests, have been delivered over by the local kings[NOTE:2] to sword, captivity, plunder, and embarrassment—right up to the present time.",
